    "Extended fasting depletes essential minerals. You MUST consume electrolytes (Sodium, Potassium, Magnesium) dissolved in water to avoid headaches, cramps, and heart palpitations.": {
      "comment": "A description of the warning for experts about the importance of consuming electrolytes during extended fasting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Длительное голодание вымывает минералы. Обязательно принимайте электролиты (натрий, калий, магний) с водой, чтобы избежать слабости и судорог."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Längeres Fasten verbraucht Mineralstoffe. Nimm unbedingt Elektrolyte (Natrium, Kalium, Magnesium) in Wasser auf, um Krämpfe zu vermeiden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El ayuno prolongado agota minerales. Toma electrolitos (sodio, potasio, magnesio) en agua para evitar dolores de cabeza y calambres."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeûne prolongé épuise les minéraux. Consommez des électrolytes (sodium, potassium, magnésium) avec de l'eau pour éviter maux de tête et crampes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il digiuno prolungato riduce i minerali. Assumi elettroliti (sodio, potassio, magnesio) in acqua per evitare mal di testa e crampi."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O jejum prolongado esgota minerais. Consuma eletrólitos (sódio, potássio, magnésio) com água para evitar dores de cabeça e cãibras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
